WEBVTT

00:00:00.351 --> 00:00:09.831
On the phone, a card waiting for approval has the Share on approval switch right under the Approve button. Before, it had the size made for a mouse pointer, and a thumb often missed it.

00:00:10.782 --> 00:00:15.502
A tap that lands a little below the switch went nowhere before: the switch stays on.

00:00:16.456 --> 00:00:25.776
Now the switch is larger on a touch screen, and its whole row, words included, is a finger tall. The same tap turns it off, and the next one on again.

00:00:26.726 --> 00:00:33.966
Every on and off switch on a touch screen now takes a tap at the first try. On a computer they stay as they were.
